Employee Management System (Frontend)
📌 Project Overview

This is the frontend module of the Employee Management System, developed using React.js.
The application supports role-based authentication where Admins manage employees and Employees can view their profile details.

The frontend is fully integrated with a cloud-deployed backend and secured using JWT authentication.

🚀 Features
🔐 Authentication

Secure login using email and password

JWT-based authentication

Role-based redirection (Admin / Employee)

👨‍💼 Admin Features

Admin login

View employee list

Add employees

Delete employees

Restricted admin access using protected routes

👩‍💻 Employee Features

Employee login

View employee dashboard

View personal profile details

Restricted from admin operations

🛠️ Tech Stack

Frontend: React.js

Routing: React Router DOM

State Management: React Hooks

API Communication: Fetch API

Styling: CSS

Backend: Node.js + Express (Hosted on Render)

Database: MongoDB Atlas

🌐 Backend API URL
https://employee-managment-system-backend-6.onrender.com

